title: Aruba Central: Access Point Radios
agents: linux, windows
author: Kuhn & Rueß GmbH <info@kuhn-ruess.de>
license: GPL
distribution: none
description:
 Monitors the radios of an Aruba access point. A radio that is down is
 WARN by default, because a disabled band is a normal configuration on
 many sites.

 The channel utilization is checked against levels of 80%/90% by default.
 TX power is recorded as a metric, channel, radio type, spatial stream
 and radio MAC address are shown in the service details.

perfdata:
 Two values: the channel utilization in percent and the TX power in dBm.

item:
 The radio name reported by Aruba Central, for example {Radio 5 GHz}.

inventory:
 One service per radio of the access point.
